---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/common/sections/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/common/sections/Footer.astro";
import StandardProse from "../components/common/typography/StandardProse.astro";
import { siteConfig } from 'virtual:site-config';
import JsonLd from "../seo/JsonLd.astro";
import { buildWebPageSchema } from "../seo";

const seoUrl = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, siteConfig.url).href;
const pageTitle = `Affiliate Disclosure - ${siteConfig.name}`;
const pageDescription = `Affiliate disclosure for ${siteConfig.name}. Learn how we earn commissions from affiliate links and how that affects our content.`;
const pageSchema = buildWebPageSchema({
	type: 'WebPage',
	name: pageTitle,
	description: pageDescription,
	url: seoUrl,
	websiteUrl: siteConfig.url,
});
---
<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} canonicalURL={seoUrl} description={pageDescription}>
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<JsonLd schema={pageSchema} />
	</Fragment>
	<Header />
	<main class="flex-1 container mx-auto px-4 py-16 max-w-4xl">
		<StandardProse>
			<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
			<p class="lead">Last updated: {siteConfig.legal.lastUpdated}</p>

			<p>
				Transparency is important to us. This Affiliate Disclosure explains how {siteConfig.name}
				earns revenue through affiliate relationships and how this may affect the content you see on
				this website.
			</p>

			<h2>1. What Is an Affiliate Link?</h2>
			<p>
				An affiliate link is a specially tracked URL that identifies {siteConfig.name} as the
				source of a referral. When you click an affiliate link and make a purchase (or complete
				another qualifying action), we may earn a commission or referral fee from the merchant —
				at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>. The price you pay is the same whether you
				use our affiliate link or visit the merchant directly.
			</p>

			<h2>2. Amazon Associates Disclosure</h2>
			<p>
				{siteConfig.name} is a participant in the <strong>Amazon Services LLC Associates Program</strong>,
				an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising
				fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and its affiliated international stores
				(including amazon.co.uk, amazon.in, amazon.ca, and others).
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong>
			</p>
			<p>
				This means that when you click a link to an Amazon product on {siteConfig.name} and
				subsequently make a purchase, we may receive a small commission. This does not affect the
				price you pay.
			</p>

			<h2>3. Other Affiliate Programs</h2>
			<p>
				In addition to Amazon, {siteConfig.name} may participate in affiliate programs offered by
				other companies and platforms. These may include, but are not limited to, software vendors,
				app developers, hosting providers, and other online retailers. In each case, we may earn a
				commission if you make a purchase or sign up for a service through our links.
			</p>
			<p>
				Where affiliate links are used in our content (such as blog posts, tool recommendations, or
				resource pages), we will clearly identify them where required. You may see labels such as
				<strong>"affiliate link"</strong>, <strong>"(paid link)"</strong>, or similar disclosures
				near the relevant link or at the top of the relevant page.
			</p>

			<h2>4. Third-Party Advertising</h2>
			<p>
				{siteConfig.name} also displays advertisements served by third-party ad networks, including
				Google AdSense and potentially other advertising partners. These are separate from affiliate
				links — they are display advertisements where we earn revenue based on ad impressions or
				clicks, not on purchases you make.
			</p>
			<p>
				Advertisers do not control our content. The appearance of an advertisement on this site
				does not constitute an endorsement of the advertiser or its products.
			</p>

			<h2>5. Our Editorial Integrity</h2>
			<p>
				Our primary purpose is to provide useful, accurate, and free tools. The existence of
				affiliate relationships does <strong>not</strong> influence which tools we build, how we
				describe them, or whether we recommend a product or service. Specifically:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>We only include affiliate links to products and services we genuinely believe are
					relevant and useful to our users</li>
				<li>We do not accept payment to write positive reviews or to feature a product</li>
				<li>Affiliate compensation does not affect the ranking, rating, or coverage of any
					product or tool on this site</li>
				<li>If a product has significant drawbacks, we will note them regardless of any affiliate
					relationship</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We believe our long-term credibility with users is worth more than any short-term
				commission. We will never compromise our editorial standards for affiliate revenue.
			</p>

			<h2>6. FTC Compliance</h2>
			<p>
				This disclosure is made in accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's (FTC) guidelines
				under 16 CFR Part 255: <em>"Guides Concerning the Use of Endorsements and Testimonials in
				Advertising."</em> These guidelines require that material connections between endorsers and
				the products or services they promote be disclosed clearly.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you are in the European Union, this disclosure also aligns with the requirements of the
				EU Unfair Commercial Practices Directive regarding transparent commercial communications.
			</p>

			<h2>7. Your Choices</h2>
			<p>
				You are never obligated to use our affiliate links. If you prefer not to support us through
				affiliate commissions, you can simply search for the product or service directly on the
				merchant's website. Our tools will always remain completely free to use regardless.
			</p>

			<h2>8. Changes to This Disclosure</h2>
			<p>
				We may update this Affiliate Disclosure as we add or remove affiliate programs. The "Last
				updated" date at the top of this page reflects when changes were last made. We encourage
				you to review this page periodically.
			</p>

			<h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
			<p>
				If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or this disclosure, please
				contact us:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`}>{siteConfig.contact.email}</a></li>
				<li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a></li>
				<li><strong>Company:</strong> {siteConfig.companyName}</li>
			</ul>
		</StandardProse>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</BaseLayout>
